Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:05.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I the answer really large is largely based on analogy with the type of AI we're using today at this point a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,large part of human knowledge is being captured by internet uh that gets downloaded cleaned and absorbed by these large foundational models
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:22.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,and uh in other modern AI succeeds because we found a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,scalable way to transfer our knowledge to these models through the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We the robotics researchers are essentially trying to apply the same idea uh to the physical world.
